{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b8b","chatId":"c800948e2f9d4fdb965de2ef48a8d29f","sessionId":null,"userId":67929,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":961,"promptTokens":1494,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068510032990238,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b8a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369685961,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b8a","chatId":"c800948e2f9d4fdb965de2ef48a8d29f","sessionId":null,"userId":67929,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n昨天考试之前，我意识到我没带笔就来参加考试。我问了我的朋友小凯是否能借他的。他给了我一支笔，并且说考完了也可以继续拿着用，因为他有很多支笔。考试完回家后，我发现我把他的笔弄丢了。我到处寻找也找不到。今天我见到小凯，我问他他花了多少钱买的笔，所以我能赔付给他相应的钱。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤感\nB) 尴尬\nC) 愧疚\nD) 惊喜\nE) 悔恨\nF) 嫉妒\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我丢了小凯的笔\nB) 凯文拒绝了我给他买笔的提议\nC) 我因为没有带笔而考试失败\nD) 凯文比我拥有的笔多得多","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068510032990238,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b8b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369685959,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4d9f98de237f4fad948385a802e06894"}